    {
      "bbox": [
        223,
        1451,
        1741,
        1765
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "I shall regard it as a personal favor if you will lend your full cooperation to Commissioner Henry L. McCarthy of the Department of Welfare, who this year is serving his second successive term as Municipal Chairman for this worthy cause.",
